@arc hollowstar
# en: The Hollow Star
name [e1bf91] = 空洞之星
# en: Omens, Investigation, Escalation, Convergence
act_names [aff64b] = 预兆、调查、升级、汇聚
# en: Something that eats light sleeps beneath the Mirror Lake, behind a door the founders sealed with seven locks. Someone wants it open.
desc [30af88] = 有一种吞噬光的东西沉睡在镜湖底下，被创始人用七道锁封在一扇门后。有人想把门打开。

@arc lyra_and_her_mother
# en: Second Place
name [604ed6] = 第二名
# en: Rivals, Cracks, Choice
act_names [254274] = 对手、裂痕、抉择
# en: Lyra Vaneshade has never once heard "well done". Her rivalry with you can become respect, friendship or more, and her mother will have something to say about all three.
desc [227832] = 莱拉·凡妮希德从未听过一句“做得好”。她与你的竞争可以变成尊重、友谊，甚至更多——而她的母亲对这三者都会有话要说。

@arc kael_thaw
# en: Thaw
name [448405] = 解冻
# en: Frost, Trust, Thaw
act_names [0abe5d] = 冰封、信任、解冻
# en: Kael Dumont was sent to open a door and came to stop it. Whether he manages depends on whether anyone is warm enough.
desc [4e1d95] = 凯尔·杜蒙被派来打开一扇门，却来阻止它。他能否做到，取决于有没有人足够温暖。

@arc ilse_dumont
# en: The Girl in White Furs
name [a99aba] = 白裘少女
# en: Arrival, The Man in Grey, North
act_names [b9bace] = 到来、灰衣人、北方
# en: Kael's sister was raised by the Hollow cult to do what he wouldn't. The man in grey wants her home. She might let him.
desc [7d861b] = 凯尔的妹妹被空洞教团养大，去做他不肯做的事。灰衣人想带她回家。她也许会跟他走。

@arc the_bell
# en: The Bell Under the Water
name [f2ca3f] = 水下的钟
# en: Echo, Rope
act_names [ee3094] = 回声、绳索
# en: The drowned bell under the Mirror Lake rings when no one is near it. Someone wants it found.
desc [e24896] = 镜湖底那口沉钟会在无人靠近时鸣响。有人想让它被找到。
